Cell["\<\
The count-less call is one vertex list; a count gives a list of distinct \
members.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"d1a05a7d-3c48-4bd7-b18f-b98fee08f230"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", "\n", "  ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
